menu "Test configuration"

config TEST_HIDS_SECURITY_REQUEST
	bool "The HID Device requests security when a Host connects"
	default y
	help
	  Use the Peripheral Security Request procedure to inform the HID Host
	  of the security requirements of the HID Device, as recommended by
	  the HID over GATT Profile. The client side of the test never initiates
	  pairing, so building the test with this disabled has to make it fail.

endmenu

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
